cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper below."
title: "Reachable reference generation and predictive path following for Generalised N-Trailer vehicles"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of a two-stage optimisation framework that generates
  a kinematically feasible reference posture for every segment of a Generalised
  N-Trailer vehicle and tracks it with a predictive controller.
